    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d632">

                <pb facs="0752" n="650" sameAs="frus:frus1919v01/pg650"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">693.003/461: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chairman of the American Delegation</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Arnold</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Shanghai</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1918-02-09T13:00:00+08:00"><hi rendition="#italic">February 9,
                                1918, 1 p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[<hi rendition="#italic">Received
                            February 9, 9.10 a.m.</hi>]</dateline></opener>
                <p>Does Department sanction American delegation joining others in agreement with
                    China for temporary surcharge of from 30 to 50 per cent on present question of
                    valuations pending final adoption of revised schedule?</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Arnold</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
